<font face="verdana,arial,helvetica" size="5"><b>Review - Kingdom Under Fire - A War of Heroes</b></font><br><br>
<table width="100%" border="0">
	<tr>
		<td colspan="2"><font face="verdana,arial,helvetica" size="4">Kingdom Under Fire : The continuing battle of good vs. evil.</font><BR></td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td valign="top"><img src='/images/Pics_boxes/2030.jpg' border='2' align='left'></td>
		<td valign="top" width="100%">
			<table border="0">
				<tr>
					<td colspan="2">
						<font face="verdana,arial,helvetica" size="2">
						<font face='verdana,arial,helvetica' size='2'>Developer: <a HREF='http://www.phantagram.com' target='_new'><font size="2">Phantagram Ltd.</a><BR>
						Reviewed by: <a HREF="mailto:cmoody@wewp.com"><font size="2">Chris Moody</a><BR>
						Reviewed on: Wednesday, April 11, 2001<BR>
					</td>
				</tr>
				<tr>
					<td><img src="/images/ESRBRating/icon-t.gif"></td>
